
<section class="crev">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="crev__head">
      <div>
        <h2>&#x2B50; Customer Reviews</h2>
        <p class="crev__sub">Real experiences from verified buyers</p>
      </div>
      <div class="crev__summary">
        <div class="crev__score">4.9<small>/5</small></div>
        <div>
          <div class="crev__stars">&#x2605;&#x2605;&#x2605;&#x2605;&#x2605;</div>
          <span class="crev__total">Based on 12,847 ratings</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="crev__bars">
      <div class="cb"><span class="cb-l">5&#x2605;</span><div class="cb-bg"><div class="cb-fill" style="width:82%"></div></div><span class="cb-p">82%</span></div>
      <div class="cb"><span class="cb-l">4&#x2605;</span><div class="cb-bg"><div class="cb-fill" style="width:12%"></div></div><span class="cb-p">12%</span></div>
      <div class="cb"><span class="cb-l">3&#x2605;</span><div class="cb-bg"><div class="cb-fill" style="width:4%"></div></div><span class="cb-p">4%</span></div>
      <div class="cb"><span class="cb-l">2&#x2605;</span><div class="cb-bg"><div class="cb-fill" style="width:1%"></div></div><span class="cb-p">1%</span></div>
      <div class="cb"><span class="cb-l">1&#x2605;</span><div class="cb-bg"><div class="cb-fill" style="width:1%"></div></div><span class="cb-p">1%</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="crev__list">
      <div class="rv">
        <div class="rv__top"><span class="rv__badge">&#x2605; 5</span><strong>Amazing Quality!</strong></div>
        <p>Bookkeeping Tracker saved me 10+ hours every month. Instant download and the Excel formulas are perfect. Customer support replied on WhatsApp in 2 minutes!</p>
        <div class="rv__meta"><span>Rohit K.</span><span>&#x2705; Verified Purchase</span><span>3 days ago</span></div>
        <div class="rv__helpful">&#x1F44D; 47 people found this helpful</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rv">
        <div class="rv__top"><span class="rv__badge">&#x2605; 5</span><strong>Best Blender at this Price!</strong></div>
        <p>Ordered via COD, received in 4 days. Blends fruits and ice perfectly. Battery lasts 15+ blends. Way better than what I expected. Definitely worth it!</p>
        <div class="rv__meta"><span>Priya S.</span><span>&#x2705; Verified Purchase</span><span>1 week ago</span></div>
        <div class="rv__helpful">&#x1F44D; 92 people found this helpful</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rv">
        <div class="rv__top"><span class="rv__badge">&#x2605; 5</span><strong>Professional Grade Templates</strong></div>
        <p>Real Estate ROI Calculator made my client presentations look professional. My clients are impressed and I closed 2 more deals this month. Must-have tool!</p>
        <div class="rv__meta"><span>Amit J.</span><span>&#x2705; Verified Purchase</span><span>5 days ago</span></div>
        <div class="rv__helpful">&#x1F44D; 63 people found this helpful</div>
      </div>
